OL,3,GNEWSALewes adopts charter recognising
OL,4,Arights of trees
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town in East Sussex has adopted a
OL,7,Fcharter recognising the rights of all
OL,8,Ftrees.
OL,10,FLast week, Lewes Town Council (LTC)
OL,11,Funanimously approved a motion granting
OL,12,Fseveral rights to trees, including the
OL,13,Fright to life, to flourish, to be
OL,14,Frestored and to complete natural life
OL,15,Fcycles.
OL,17,FThe motion, created by a number of
OL,18,Fgroups working together since May, was
OL,19,Fguided by a toolkit developed by Dr
OL,20,FJoanna Miller Smallwood, who leads the
OL,21,FEnvironmental Justice Law Clinic at the
OL,22,FUniversity of Sussex.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
